},"chairman":{"type":["object","null"],"required":["name","source","confidence"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"source":{"type":"string"},"confidence":{"enum":["low","medium","high"],"description":"low = community data that may be out of date (Wikidata); medium = exchange or registry data; high = checked by hand against the company's own page or filing (source is that URL)"}},"additionalProperties":false},"slogan":{"type":["string","null"]}},"additionalProperties":false},"logo":{"type":"object","required":["svg","file","png","brandColor","brandColorSource","isPlaceholder","provenance","provenanceSource"],"properties":{"svg":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uri","description":"Vector logo; null for the 107 older companies that only have a PNG (use `file`)"},"file":{"type":"object","required":["url","format"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"format":{"enum":["svg","png"]}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The logo file in the logos/ folder, always present"},"png":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"PNG URLs by pixel size (64, 128, 256, 512); present for the 3,000 largest companies","additionalProperties":{"type":"string","format":"uri"}},"brandColor":{"type":["string","null"],"pattern":"^#[0-9A-F]{6}$","description":"Taken from the logo file: an approximation, not an official brand colour"},"brandColorSource":{"type":["string","null"]},"isPlaceholder":{"type":"boolean","description":"true = generated initials badge, not a real logo"},"provenance":{"enum":["official","commons","crawled","generated"],"description":"Where the square icon comes from. official = the owner's site, press kit or an official document; commons = Wikimedia Commons; crawled = TradingView's symbol-logo service, not checked file by file; generated = initials badge. Show only official and commons when you need logos with a known source."},"provenanceSource":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uri","description":"The page or file the logo was taken fro